# Ignore generated + vendored content. Prettier already skips
# .gitignore'd paths via --ignore-path default, but being explicit here
# documents the intent so a CI that sets --ignore-path=false still
# behaves reasonably.

# Build outputs
**/dist/
**/build/
**/.next/
**/out/
**/coverage/

# Lockfiles — Prettier would rewrite them in the repo's style, but
# npm manages the exact formatting. Format drift would cause pointless
# churn on every `npm install`.
package-lock.json
yarn.lock
pnpm-lock.yaml

# Generated schemas
**/prisma/migrations/

# Editor junk
.vscode/
.idea/

# Internal planning notes (gitignored anyway)
IMPLEMENTACION_NANORUN.md
INVESTIGACION_NANORUN_2026.md
PENDIENTE.md

# .claude tooling artifacts
.claude/
